stion/math-academy-id "q-129209" :question/problem "What is the sum of the leading entries of the $1$st and $4$th rows in the matrix $A,$ given below?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -9 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 8 & 9 & -8 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 9 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The first non-zero entry of each row (from left to right) is the leading entry. \n\nTherefore, the leading entries of the $1$st and $4$th rows of  $A$ are $-4$ and $9$, respectively.\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -9 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 8 & 9 & -8 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 9 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSo, the answer is $-4+9=5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129209/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "31c3678b-4f00-54d6-bb84-c7718fd622cb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129209"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-42364/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "c46a3f3b-4c41-5116-991e-d32774faf68a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42364/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "e23522c1-869a-5078-b3b2-b4c9faf56a3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42364/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "16df42c9-2c1e-5b72-9e79-3db68ee0f693" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42364/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "e4a77f39-d871-5818-bf08-70a45cec99dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42364/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "7e83e145-8e04-5580-91f5-a0e6b63789a0" :answer/type :ans