& 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The first non-zero entry of each row (from left to right) is the leading entry. \n\nTherefore, the leading entries of the $1$st, $2$nd, and $3$rd rows of $A$ are $-3$, $5$, and $2$, respectively.\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -3 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the answer is $-3+5+2=4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129204/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "31c3678b-4f00-54d6-bb84-c7718fd622cb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129204"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73148/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "760bf893-a58a-56f3-ad83-4718cb8f84ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73148/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "5a192ef9-2a90-5972-b413-5992a8f83b60" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73148/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "fb93c99f-65f0-574d-9bbd-005c2a934a1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73148/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "14ec15f6-2062-5f06-ac6f-790c4aaadedd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73148/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "5197e390-8365-5e16-95c7-e25c10a6deca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73148/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f1a325a9-0c43-5d0d-ad7a-fe4c5f98f8e5" :answer-field/key "se